 "kind": "answer",
 "message": "Yes. Under the company holidays policy, if you have to work a company holiday (dispatch on-call is named as an example), you get a replacement day off within 60 days.\n\nThe policy doesn't say what the 60 days are counted from, and it doesn't say how you pick the day off. Confirm the details with your manager or HR. The official list of the 11 paid company holidays is in the HR portal, so check that Thanksgiving and Christmas are on it.\n\nAlso note that the offices close from December 25 to January 1 inclusive, so Christmas falls within that closure.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-HOL-01"
 ]
}
